7.description:
The Monthly Auto-Battle Card is valid for 30 days. While it is valid, you will be entitled to the following Auto-Battle privileges:
Number of Auto-Battles that can be conducted in a batch is increased to 5;
Auto-Battle can be conducted on two separate maps simultaneously;
Auto-Battles yield 50% more EXP;
Only 1 echelon is needed for each Auto-Battle;
A reward of 20 Quick Auto-Battle Contracts upon purchasing or renewing your Monthly Auto-Battle Card;
A reward of 6 Quick Auto-Battle Contracts every day.
